  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your haiku variety is hampered by one topic you obviously adore above others.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Haiku class feature, warrior poet level 3rd</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you first gain Topic Favoritism, choose a topic that you know with an On cost of 1. Whenever you change the composition of your haiku, you may add this topic to one of your haiku subjects as though it had an On cost of 0.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may gain Topic Favoritism multiple times. Each time, the required warrior poet level increases by +6. Multiple topics that have had their On cost set to 0 by Topic Favoritism may not be added to the same haiku.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
